{"headword":"זוּר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> be a stranger <strong>(</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">زَارَ</span> (med. و <em>incline toward, repair to, visit;</em> ii. <em>honour as visitor or guest;</em> ix. <em>decline, turn aside;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">زَاىِٔرٌ</span> <em>visitor;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">זוּר</span>, often = Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">סוּר</span> <em>turn aside, turn aside to visit</em><strong>)—</strong>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹר֫וּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:4\" href=\"/Psalms.58.4\">ψ 58:4</a> (Kö<sup>i 445</sup>), <span dir=\"rtl\">זָ֫רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:30\" href=\"/Psalms.78.30\">ψ 78:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:13\" href=\"/Job.19.13\">Jb 19:13</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:33\" href=\"/Exodus.30.33\">Ex 30:33</a> + 27 times; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:9\" href=\"/Exodus.30.9\">Ex 30:9</a> + 7 times; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:7\" href=\"/Hosea.5.7\">Ho 5:7</a> + 30 times; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.14\">Pr 22:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:33\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.33\">23:33</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרָ֑יִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.5\">Is 29:5</a>;"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <em>become estranged</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:4\" href=\"/Psalms.58.4\">ψ 58:4</a>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span> <em>from</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:13\" href=\"/Job.19.13\">Jb 19:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:30\" href=\"/Psalms.78.30\">ψ 78:30</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pt. as adj. <em>strange</em>, or as noun <em>stranger:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"to the family, of another household, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ זָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.5\">Dt 25:5</a>, elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">ז